      en: ["Peak elevation is 6,057 meters", "Consists of four main summits", "Regarded as the easiest 6,000 m peak to climb", "A source of white sillar volcanic rock", "Lacks permanent glaciers due to dry climate", "Located only 22 km from Arequipa"],
